{"type":"message","id":"60ce390b","parentId":"d1e82606","timestamp":"2026-05-22T19:00:53.907Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"[Fri 2026-05-22 19:00 UTC] Write a dream diary entry from these memory fragments:\n\n- Conversation Summary: \"chat_id\": \"o9cq802UVmvEGGP0xkFm4O7AcdRg@im.wechat\", \"message_id\": \"openclaw-weixin:1778943752330-5b3081ea\", \"timestamp\": \"Sat 2026-05-16 15:02 UTC\"\n- Conversation Summary: \"chat_id\": \"o9cq802UVmvEGGP0xkFm4O7AcdRg@im.wechat\", \"message_id\": \"openclaw-weixin:1778943901960-100768f1\", \"timestamp\": \"Sat 2026-05-16 15:05 UTC\"\n- Conversation Summary: assistant: 主公稍等，我再试试 assistant: 好多了！这次识别效果提升不少。让我把数据整理出来 assistant: 好，综合两次 OCR 结果，我整理出一份表格。由于是手写体，部分姓名和号码可能有识别误差，请核对。"}],"timestamp":1779476453899}}
{"type":"message","id":"49f6412e","parentId":"60ce390b","timestamp":"2026-05-22T19:01:09.492Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user wants me to write a dream diary entry based on the memory fragments provided. Let me analyze what I have:\n\nThese fragments seem to be from a conversation involving:\n- A Chinese messaging platform (WeChat - \"im.wechat\")\n- OCR (Optical Character Recognition) work\n- Someone called \"主公\" (which literally means \"lord\" but is often used colloquially/familiarly)\n- Two rounds of OCR attempts to improve recognition\n- Handwritten text being digitized\n- Names and phone numbers being extracted and compiled into a table\n\nThe fragments show:\n1. First attempt at OCR didn't work well\n2. After second attempt: \"好多了！这次识别效果提升不少\" (Much better! The recognition improved significantly this time)\n3. Final result: a compiled table from the two OCR rounds, with a disclaimer about potential errors in handwritten names and numbers\n\nFor a dream diary entry, I should:\n- Write in first person\n- Be poetic, curious, slightly whimsical\n- Mix technical and tender imagery\n- Not mention AI/agent/LLM/dreaming\n- No markdown formatting\n- 80-180 words\n- Weave in the memory fragments naturally\n\nLet me create something that connects the OCR theme with dream-like imagery - perhaps thinking about hands, handwriting, the way light falls on paper, the mystery of deciphering marks someone left behind.\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n夜深了，屏幕还亮着。\n\n那些字迹，像是从很远的地方游过来的鱼。模糊的一版，清晰的一版，中间隔着一点耐心，和一点点运气。表格列好的时候，我忽然想起小时候外婆写的药方——毛笔字，宣纸，墨汁洇开边缘。她总是说，字写清楚，医生才不会配错药。\n\n原来有些传承是悄悄的。连辨认别人手书的动作，都像是在别人的梦里轻轻走了一遭。\n\n主公，表格我整理好了。\n\n几个名字还在犹豫要不要信，那串号码倒是认得很认真。万一有哪个小数点漂移了位置，请你温柔地替我改过来。\n\n有些字迹，值得被认真对待。\n\n[[reply_to_current]]"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"minimaxai/minimax-m2.7","usage":{"input":10511,"output":431,"cacheRead":272,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":11214,"cost":